{"name":"Mushroom Quiche","permalink":"mushroom-quiche","edit":"https://github.com/The-Silverwood-Institute/Recibase/tree/master/src/main/scala/se/reciba/api/recibase/recipes/MushroomQuiche.scala","source":null,"description":null,"tagline":null,"notes":["Take the pastry out of the fridge 40 mins before use!"],"dated_notes":[],"tags":["Stodge","Slow","Vegetarian"],"inherited_tags":["Pescatarian","Vegetarian-ish"],"image":null,"ingredients_blocks":[{"name":null,"ingredients":[{"name":"Chestnut mushrooms","quantity":"250g","prep":"sliced","notes":null},{"name":"Dried mushrooms","quantity":"handful","prep":null,"notes":"Porcini, shiitake, wild, etc"},{"name":"Red onion","quantity":"1","prep":"sliced","notes":null},{"name":"Parmesan","quantity":null,"prep":"Grated","notes":null},{"name":"Mascarpone","quantity":"2 tbsp","prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Eggs","quantity":"2","prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Salt","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Black pepper","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Wholegrain Mustard","quantity":"2 tsp","prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Shortcrust pastry sheet","quantity":"230g","prep":null,"notes":null}]}],"method":["Place the dried mushrooms in a small amount of boiling water to rehydrate.","Add some oil to a wide pan and soften the onion.","Add the mushrooms to the pan and cook until soft.","Add the mascarpone, eggs, mustard, salt and black pepper to a mixing bowl and beat together.","Add the mushroom mixture and dried mushrooms to the mixing bowl, including the water used to rehydrate the mushrooms if desired.","Place the pastry in a 9 inch flan dish, rerolling it if necessary.","Pour the mixture into the dish and top with the grated parmesan.","Bake in the oven at 200C/gas 6 for 20 minutes."]}